   396	## 6. Kits and explorer (L5, L6)
   397	
   398	- `Kit.Engine`: protocol-agnostic lemmas over any state projection that
   399	  is monotone under `process`: honest origin of signed objects, transfer
   400	  within Δ after GST and on a healthy prefix, relay closure, clean start.
   401	  Proved once over the engine.
   402	- `Kit.Goldfish`: the shared substrate of Grid CO, SA, SA-PC and L*
   403	  (block store, vote pool with equivocation, receipt stamps, frozen
   404	  views, records). Optional for new instances.
   405	- `Kit.FG`: the fixed Simplex FG module (§7): its state, rules,
   406	  evidence, and lemmas (C)–(F) and FG-internal claims, proved once.
   407	- `Kit.Compose`: product of two specs with wiring, and the anchored
   408	  composition theorem (§7).
   409	- Explorer: each instance's functions are computable (already true).
   410	  Each catalog entry gets a decidable checker of its conclusion on a
   411	  finite run, and each regime a decidable checker of its premises
   412	  (a computable replacement for `awakeInClosed`). A found run is
   413	  emitted as a Lean file that proves a `Refutation` by `decide`.
