     9	/-- A structural chain block. Protocol wire objects belong to an instance.
    10	A block has no proposer identity: the proposer of slot `s` signs with the
    11	slot-scoped `Auth.proposer s` (see `Objects/Seats.lean`). -/
    12	inductive Block where
